**Explanation**: This example demonstrates how to integrate the SST Console with a monorepo setup. The `./infra/console.ts` module defines the console configuration with environment-specific settings. The script `./scripts/deploy-pr.js` is used for deploying PR previews from CI/CD workflows. GitHub Actions is configured to automatically deploy previews for pull requests and post comments with deployment information. A React component is provided to display build information with a link to the SST Console. This setup enables efficient preview environments, comprehensive monitoring, and easy access to deployment details, enhancing the development workflow in a monorepo.

